{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-pro-27-1","title":"Proverbs 27:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Observations of self love; 5 of true love; 11 of care to avoid offenses; 23 and of the household care.</p>\n<p>Boast. Ps 95:7; Isa 56:12; Lu 12:19,20; 2Co 6:2; Jas 4:13-16 to-morrow. Heb. to-morrow day. thou. 1Sa 28:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-2","title":"Proverbs 27:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>25:27; 2Co 10:12,18; 12:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-3","title":"Proverbs 27:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>heavy. Heb. heaviness. but. 17:12; Ge 34:25,26; 49:7; 1Sa 22:18,19; Es 3:5,6; Da 3:19; 1Jo 3:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-4","title":"Proverbs 27:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>cruel, and anger is outrageous. Heb. cruelty, and anger anoverflowing. Jas 1:19-21 but. 14:30; Ge 26:14; 37:11; Job 5:2; Mt 27:18; Ac 5:17; *marg: Ac 7:9; 17:5; Ro 1:29; Jas 3:14-16; 4:5,6; 1Jo 3:12 envy. or, jealousy. 6:34; So 8:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-5","title":"Proverbs 27:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>28:23; Le 19:17; Mt 18:15; Ga 2:14; 1Ti 5:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-6","title":"Proverbs 27:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>the wounds. 2Sa 12:7-15; Job 5:17,18; Ps 141:5; Heb 12:10; Re 3:19 the kisses. 10:18; 26:23-26; 2Sa 20:9,10; Mt 26:48-50 deceitful. or, earnest, or, frequent.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-7","title":"Proverbs 27:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>full. Nu 11:4-9,18-20; 21:5 loatheth. Heb. treadeth under foot. to. Job 6:7; Lu 15:16,17; Joh 6:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-8","title":"Proverbs 27:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>a bird. Job 39:14-16; Isa 16:2 man. 21:16; Ge 4:16; 16:6-8; 1Sa 22:5; 27:1-12; 1Ki 19:9; Ne 6:11-13 Jon 1:3,10-17; 1Co 7:20; Jude 1:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-9","title":"Proverbs 27:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Ointment. 7:17; Jud 9:9; Ps 45:7,8; 104:15; 133:2; So 1:3; 3:6; 4:10; Joh 12:3 2Co 2:15,16 so. 15:23; 16:21,23,24; Ex 18:17-24; 1Sa 23:16,17; Ezr 10:2-4 Ac 28:15 by hearty counsel. Heb. from the counsel of the soul.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-10","title":"Proverbs 27:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>own. 2Sa 19:24,28; 21:7; 1Ki 12:6-8; 2Ch 24:22; Isa 41:8-10; Jer 2:5 neither. 19:7; Job 6:21-23; Ob 1:12-14 better. 17:17; 18:24; Lu 10:30-37; Ac 23:12,23-35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-11","title":"Proverbs 27:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>be wise. 10:1; 15:20; 23:15,16,24,25; Ec 2:18-21; Phm 1:7,19,20; 2Jo 1:4 that I. Ps 119:42; 127:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-12","title":"Proverbs 27:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>18:10; 22:3; Ex 9:20,21; Ps 57:1-3; Isa 26:20,21; Mt 3:7; Heb 6:18 Heb 11:7; 2Pe 3:7,10-14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-13","title":"Proverbs 27:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>6:1-4; 20:16; 22:26,27; Ex 22:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-14","title":"Proverbs 27:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>He that. 2Sa 15:2-7; 16:16-19; 17:7-13; 1Ki 22:6,13; Jer 28:2-4 Ac 12:22,23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-15","title":"Proverbs 27:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>A continual. 19:13; 21:9,19; 25:24; Job 14:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-16","title":"Proverbs 27:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>the ointment. Joh 12:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-17","title":"Proverbs 27:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>Iron. 1Sa 13:20,21 so. 9; Jos 1:18; 2:24; 1Sa 11:9,10; 23:16; 2Sa 10:11,12; Job 4:3,4 Isa 35:3,4; 1Th 3:3; 2Ti 1:8,12; 2:3,9-13; Heb 10:24; Jas 1:2 1Pe 4:12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-18","title":"Proverbs 27:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>keepeth. So 8:12; 1Co 9:7,13 so. 17:2; 22:29; Ge 24:2,3; 39:2-5,22,23; Ex 24:13; 2Ki 3:11 2Ki 5:2,3,25,27; Mr 10:43; Ac 10:7; Col 3:22 shall be. 1Sa 2:30; Ps 123:2; Mt 24:25,46; 25:21,22; Lu 12:37,43,44 Joh 12:26; 1Pe 2:18,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-19","title":"Proverbs 27:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>in. Jas 1:22-25 so. Ge 6:5; Ps 33:15; Mr 7:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-20","title":"Proverbs 27:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>Hell. 30:15,16; Hab 2:5 never. Heb. not. so. 23:5; Ec 1:8; 2:10,11; 5:10,11; 6:7; Jer 22:17; 1Jo 2:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-21","title":"Proverbs 27:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>the fining. 17:3; Ps 12:6; 66:10; Zec 13:9; Mal 3:3; 1Pe 1:7; 4:12 so. 1Sa 18:7,8,15,16,30; 2Sa 14:25; 15:6-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-22","title":"Proverbs 27:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>23:35; Ex 12:30; 14:5; 15:9; 2Ch 28:22,23; Isa 1:5; Jer 5:3 Jer 44:15,16; Re 16:10,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-23","title":"Proverbs 27:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>diligent. Ge 31:38-40; 33:13; 1Sa 17:28; 1Ch 27:29-31; 2Ch 26:10 Eze 34:22-24,31; Joh 21:15-17; 1Pe 5:2 look well. Heb. set thy heart. 24:32; *marg: Ex 7:23; De 32:46</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-24","title":"Proverbs 27:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>For. 23:5; Zep 1:18; 1Ti 6:17,18 riches. Heb. strength. Jas 1:10 doth. 2Sa 7:16; Ps 89:36; Isa 9:7 every generation. Heb. generation and generation.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-25","title":"Proverbs 27:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>hay.Rather, herbage, as {chatzir} uniformly denotes.</p>\n<p>10:5; Ps 104:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-26","title":"Proverbs 27:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>Job 31:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-27-27","title":"Proverbs 27:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>enough. 30:8,9; Mt 6:33 maintenance. Heb. life.</p>"}]}